\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Efficiency Over Empathy:
\f0\b0  In high-stress moments, bypassing active listening or human impact checks to force a quick decision, which can come across as cold, blunt, or dismissive.\uc0\u8232 \
\ls2\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Subtle Credit Management:
\f0\b0  While you score high in humility, a moderate narcissism signal suggests you may occasionally feel a quiet resentment if your contributions go entirely unnoticed, potentially leading to passive attempts to ensure your value is visible to superiors.\uc0\u8232 \
